    images: ["https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/01-decision-layer-hero.8b04bafa.png", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/01-decision-layer-hero.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/02-decision-layer-workshop.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/03-decision-layer-decision-spine.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/04-decision-layer-object-anatomy.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/05-decision-layer-case-object.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/06-decision-layer-design-system.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/07-decision-layer-in-code.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/08-decision-layer-prototype-to-product.jpg", "https://marliin-recipient-worker.brett-6a3.workers.dev/images/agentic-decision-layer-defense/09-decision-layer-analytics-wrong-word.png"],
    tags: ["agentic-systems", "ai", "ai-native-prototyping", "ai-product", "design-systems", "information-architecture", "interaction-architecture", "product-design"],
    context: "I was the founding design partner at an early-stage defense tech company. We built an autonomous decision-making layer to improve the cyber readiness of our fleet, with the system running fully offline in high-security settings.",
    problem: "Once a vulnerability has been found, a severity score can easily be obtained but does not deal with the questions that determine what actually takes place, specifically, whether or not the affected component is installed, how many mission-critical assets it affects, and whether the vulnerability can be cured without bringing the fleet to a halt. Although the score is one input to this decision, it is often taken as the decision itself.",
